From 17403f0e0b9bd8b1341a21c284cfb504d25564a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yooz <136268860+y-o-o-z@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 21:37:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 17/18] local: head polish - document language, pinch zoom,
 font preload

Three things found while auditing the page from outside.

The document declared lang="en" while the interface is Polish, which misleads
hyphenation, spell checking and screen readers. It is now "pl".

The viewport carried user-scalable=no, blocking pinch zoom on a phone - an
accessibility rule broken for years and nothing here depends on it. Replaced
with initial-scale=1.

Geist and Geist Mono are self-hosted and correct (woff2, font-display: swap,
latin/latin-ext split with unicode-range so Polish diacritics work and only the
needed subset downloads), but nothing preloaded them, so the browser discovered
them only after parsing brand.css and the first paint ran in a fallback face.
The two faces used from the first frame are preloaded now.

Note on the preload URLs: they deliberately carry no ?v=cacheBust. brand.css
references the files without a query string, and a preload whose URL differs by
even a query is a separate resource to the browser - it would download the font
twice and log "preloaded but not used".
---
 client/index.html.tpl | 10 ++++++++--
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/client/index.html.tpl b/client/index.html.tpl
index 8986f144..cc827114 100644
--- a/client/index.html.tpl
+++ b/client/index.html.tpl
@@ -1,12 +1,18 @@
 <!doctype html>
-<html lang="en">
+<html lang="pl">
     <head>
 
     <meta charset="utf-8">
-    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, user-scalable=no">
+    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
 
     <link rel="preload" as="script" href="js/loading-error-handlers.js?v=<%- cacheBust %>">
     <link rel="modulepreload" href="js/bundle.js?v=<%- cacheBust %>">
+    <!-- Fonty uzywane od pierwszej klatki: bez preload przegladarka odkrywa je
+         dopiero po sparsowaniu brand.css, wiec pierwszy render leci fallbackiem. -->
+    <link rel="preload" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin
+          href="themes/shellter/fonts/geist-latin-400.woff2">
+    <link rel="preload" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin
+          href="themes/shellter/fonts/geist-mono-latin-400-normal.woff2">
 
     <link rel="stylesheet" href="themes/shellter/brand.css?v=<%- cacheBust %>">
 
